note bottom of OBS
  Candidate queues retain unknown cells because
  hidden blockers must not change which proposals
  the model receives. The host checks one selected
  queue through native admission without retries
  or a heuristic rescue.
end note

note bottom of PREFIX
  An appended action stores its native anchor from
  the earlier own prefix so later actions cannot
  revise that decision. Reservations never assume
  mine removal, failed drops, or refunds from
  unresolved combat.
end note

